
>> countries := ਲਿਸਟ ਨਵਾਂ
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := ਲਿਸਟ ਨਵਾਂ
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods ਅਨੁਸਾਰ: countries, ਹਰੇਕ: { :key :value
	counter ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ: 1.
}.

ਆਉਟਪੁੱਟ ਲਿਖੋ: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), ਨਵੀਂ-ਲਾਈਨ.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] ਅੱਖਰ-ਸੂਚੀ ਤਰਤੀਬ: { :v
	counter ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ: 0.
}.

ਆਉਟਪੁੱਟ ਲਿਖੋ: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), ਨਵੀਂ-ਲਾਈਨ.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


ਆਉਟਪੁੱਟ ਲਿਖੋ: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), ਨਵੀਂ-ਲਾਈਨ.

